# Project Context

Always refer to these files when working on this project:

* `automation_setup_prompt.md` — framework setup guidelines
* `script_generation.md` — how to generate new BDD automation
* `test_debugging_prompt.md` — debugging instructions and patterns

## Cursor wiring

* Skills: `.cursor/skills/automation-setup`, `script-generation`, `test-debugging`
* File-scoped rule: `.cursor/rules/playwright-bdd.mdc`

## Architecture (non-negotiable)

This repo is **BDD-only**:

```
Feature Files → Step Definitions → Page Objects
   (WHAT)          (GLUE)            (HOW)
```

* Do **not** create new Playwright `.spec.ts` tests for coverage
* Step defs call Page Object methods (no raw selectors in steps)
* Prefer fluent waits; avoid `waitForTimeout()`
